|Main Details=Bugzilladon emerged from a catastrophic system crash that fused ancient debugging tools with rogue malware. Its armored shell is layered with obsolete patches and encrypted regrets. As it stomps through digital wastelands, it absorbs unresolved bugs to fuel its strength. Legends say it once debugged an entire server farm with a single punch, leaving behind only a glowing comment: <code>// fixed</code>.

Bugzilladon is said to roam the ruins of deprecated systems, feeding on memory leaks and broken loops. Its fists are forged from firewall fragments, and its roar sounds like a corrupted boot sequence. Rivaled only by [[Patchgeist]], Bugzilladon represents the brute force of unresolved code — a living monument to every dev’s darkest sprint.
